<title>HONG KONG: Shougang Century 1996 net down 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Shougang Century 1996 net down 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 4.3	  vs 16.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil	  vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	19.33 gain vs 36.15 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  29.68	vs 85.72</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,646.72   vs 1,701.60</p>
<p>    Company name	     Shougang Concord Century Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Shougang Concord Century is a minerals and metals trader.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on dilution of the group's interest in an associated company and amount receivable in connection with the profit warranty on Endless Group.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs four H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
